<title>JAPAN: Japan 3-month T-bill auction lowest price 99.905.</title>
<headline>Japan 3-month T-bill auction lowest price 99.905.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finance Ministry said its auction of 1.3 trillion yen worth of three-month Treasury bills (T-bills) on Tuesday produced the following results:</p>
<p>Lowest price     99.905  Stop rate     0.377 pct</p>
<p>Average price    99.906  Average yield 0.371 pct</p>
<p>Total bids	   5.0732  trillion yen</p>
<p>Accepted Bids	1.2997  trillion yen</p>
<p>Bid to cover ratio 3.90  times</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 65.8773 pct</p>
<p>Issue date	 Sept 20</p>
<p>Maturity    Dec 20</p>
</text>
